message: "If you use this code or data, please cite it as below and cite the original dataset publications listed in DATA_SOURCES.md."
title: "Reference capacity, end-of-life threshold and endpoint rule in lithium-ion battery SOH/RUL benchmarks: code, processed data and supplementary materials"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Yang
    given-names: Jianhao
    affiliation: "School of Materials and Environment, Guangxi Minzu University"
